{"synopsis":"Aku bereinkarnasi ke dalam novel harem terbalik yang menyedihkan dan tak berdaya, tetapi entah kenapa protagonis wanitanya meninggal. Keterkejutan atas kehancuran dan hilangnya novel aslinya hanya sesaat. Para kakak perempuan mulai terhubung dengan para protagonis pria. Kepada kaisar yang ceria dan obsesif, kakak perempuan tertua yang dewasa dan penyayang. Kepada jaksa penuntut terkuat dalam pandangan dunia yang blak-blakan, kakak perempuan…","alternative_title":"피폐 역하렘 남주들의 막내 처제가 되었다","author":"Madrum","artist":"Eunren, Rina (ii)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"c3f56ca8-086c-462f-9858-4496fb4270ad","number":"77","chapter":"77","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"bacc70fa-12b2-4cfe-8871-a47a1e54f09f","number":"76","chapter":"76","title":"","date":"2026-07-27","released":"2026-07-27"},{"chapter_id":"d70fb7ce-d589-409f-ac74-79727e6ce358","number":"75","chapter":"75","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"747d18f9-1111-4d24-89de-d9e9ea6a21bd","number":"74","chapter":"74","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"446b8d71-1762-4948-b31d-e3667ffc0fd9","number":"73","chapter":"73","title":"","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"3273fa74-1dd5-4f64-9ba3-dedf9449e251","number":"72","chapter":"72","title":"","date":"2026-07-07","released":"2026-07-07"},{"chapter_id":"b2ec1506-0c67-46b9-ab7e-d66429406b7c","number":"71","chapter":"71","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"252f7966-4e8e-4b36-bfdc-055f449a2d13","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2026-06-15","released":"2026-06-15"},{"chapter_id":"b47b34ff-a358-4c80-a42d-62346ffcad31","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2026-06-11","released":"2026-06-11"},{"chapter_id":"995d6516-b205-4758-b17d-4db35c630eb6","number":"68","chapter":"68","title":"","date":"2026-06-05","released":"2026-06-05"},{"chapter_id":"be793887-553c-4211-9e3f-db0c0cd62902","nu